
  Fenrir Linux live environment
  ---------------------------------------------------------------
  1. Get online
       Ethernet connects by itself. For Wi-Fi run:   nmtui
  2. (optional) Change the keyboard layout, e.g.:    loadkeys de
  3. Install Fenrir Linux:                               fenrir-install

  Manual partitioning: mount your root at /mnt (and the EFI system
  partition at /mnt/boot/efi), then pick "use what's mounted at
  /mnt" in fenrir-install.

